    "note": "OpenMU VersionSeasonSix (KanturuRelics.cs:276): level 119, 94000 life, 946-996, 783, 1015/906, attack range 2. Beside the Twin Tale (b9377590), its numbers the Twin Tale's times OpenMU's ratio between the two (life 1.07, damage 1.01, defence 0.91, attack rate 0.94), one level above the Persona; ranges and speeds as MU. Its defence rate not OpenMU's 2.06 of the Twin Tale's (2,780: the best pre-Kanturu kits landed so few blows that the wizard made 4 kills to 57 deaths across the sweep) but 1,650, still the Relics' hardest to hit: at its nest 164,129 the kits make 243 / 123 / 117 kills an hour (knight / wizard / elf, best skill), the wizard dying 3 times an hour, mostly to Personas. Provisional, ours (2026-10-25)."
  },
