      "axis": "through",
      "note": "Move_Kanturu2nd_BlurEffect MODEL_DREADFEAR (GM_Kanturu_2nd.cpp:1315-1340): Attack 1 up to key 5 and Attack 2 up to key 9, ten CreateBlur type 4 a frame in white from bone 33 (Line02, its sword) out (100, 120, 0) in its own axes: 156 units, rigid on the hand. Ours along the line from Bip01 R Finger1 to Line02, which runs 21 degrees off MU's blade (FK of the rig): Line02 lies 0.07 m along it and MU's end 1.52 m along and 0.56 m off, at scale 1. One until for both swings: Attack 2's 9, so Attack 1's blur runs through its last three keys where MU stops at 5. An offset in a bone's own axes does not survive the Blender rebuild."
    },
    "note": "fx/dreadfear.h: its two teal eyes, the cloud its wings shed as it moves and swings, the smoke they break into as it dies."
  },
